## To total (pairs: Seq of (Text, Int)) -> Int:
    Let mutable sum be 0.
    Repeat for (name, n) in pairs:
        Set sum to sum + n.
    Return sum.

## Main
Let xs be a new Seq of (Text, Int).
Push ("a", 1) to xs.
Push ("b", 2) to xs.
Push ("a", 1) to xs.
Repeat for (v, n) in xs:
    Show v + "!".
    Show n + 1.
Show total(xs).
Let seen be a new Set of (Text, Int).
Repeat for (v, n) in xs:
    Add (v, n) to seen.
Show the count of seen.
